    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "This is an exceptional detached residence situated in a lovely location at Rockfield Park, Rahoon, within walking distance of the University of Galway, UHG, schools, church, and shopping centres. Enjoys easy access to city centre and Salthill region. \r\n\r\nNo.1 offers excellent living space throughout the house which features a fabulous kitchen with hob and oven, microwave, and dishwasher included. Lovely spacious sitting room with open fireplace. Double glazing throughout. Oil fired central heating. Gorgeous rear garden and patio area. Spacious detached garage. Superb off street parking. \r\n\r\nComprising: sitting room, kitchen/ dining room with patio doors to lovely garden, downstairs storage plumbed for washing machine. First floor has four family sized bedrooms, three with built in units. Main bathroom with WC and WHB. Spacious landing.\r\n\r\nThis is a very fine detached property in a wonderful residential area. So close to every city amenity. Viewing very highly recommended.\r\n\r\nFull details with John Quinn. 091 569 174."
      },
